            "review_title": "Review at Shala Vegan House",
            "review_text": "thang q\n16 contributions\n0\nGreat place\nSep 2024 • Family\nOkay Shala Vegan is my new favorite spot in Da Nang and possibly all of Vietnam so far. While there are plenty of veg spots, most use so much MSG, soy and crappy oils. I really try to stay away from soy proteins and mock meats in general.\n\nThis spot is super healthy…non-gmo…etc. Felt great leaving here and got a bunch of stuff for later.\n\nTry the Jade Fried Rice, brown Rice Pancakes, Spring Rolls and Noodles With Peanut sauce…\nRead more\nWritten September 10, 2024",
